				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
			<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default"><div class="title" style="font-weight:500">Streaming</div></h2>		</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-bcc70e8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="bcc70e8" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<p>The event will broadcast <b>live on <a href="https://www.twitch.tv/pokemon" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Twitch</a> and </b><a href="https://www.youtube.com/@PlayPokemon" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><b>YouTube</b></a> by TPCi, with <a href="https://x.com/tapu_kyriakou"><b>Ben Kyriakou</b></a>, <a href="https://x.com/Chazingdra"><b>Charlie Merriman</b></a>, <a href="https://x.com/DavidPartVGC"><b>David Partingon</b></a>, <strong><a href="https://x.com/JamieBoytVGC">Jamie Boyt</a></strong> and <strong><a href="https://x.com/louthepikachu">Lou Akcoş-Cromie</a></strong> as casters, and <a href="https://victoryroad.pro/2023/09/13/european-regionals-2024/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Victory Road behind the scenes</a>.</p><ul><li><b>Day 1</b> (Swiss rounds): stream starts on <b>26 September at 07:00 UTC</b></li><li><b>Day 2 </b>(Swiss rounds + Top Cut): stream starts on <b>27 September at 06:40 UTC</b></li></ul>						</div>
				</div>
