				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-837c1fe elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="837c1fe" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<p>If prize money is $5000 or more, it will be given as a choice of scholarship (in all cases) or cash (for minors, as a Pokémon Visa<sup>®</sup> Prepaid Card). For lower prizes, it will be given as cash (for minors, as a Pokémon Visa<sup>®</sup> Prepaid Card).</p>						</div>
				</div>
					</div>
		</div>
							</div>
		</section>
				<section class="elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-a7f98eb elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default" data-id="a7f98eb" data-element_type="section">
						<div class="elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default">
					<div class="elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-421655f" data-id="421655f" data-element_type="column">
			<div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated">
								<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-3a0cb54 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer" data-id="3a0cb54" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="spacer.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<div class="elementor-spacer">
			<div class="elementor-spacer-inner"></div>
		</div>
				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-ef2aa24 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="ef2aa24" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
			<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default"><div class="title" style="font-weight:500">Overview</div></h2>		</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-718fde6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="718fde6" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<p>The <b>Frankfurt Regional Championships</b> is an official TPCi Regional-level event for Pokémon VGC, TCG and <i>Pokémon GO</i>. It is the first Regional-level event of the <a href="https://victoryroad.pro/2027-season-calendar/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">2027 season</a> in the European circuit.</p><p>For the first time ever, as per the Germany ratings of the game, the <b>Junior version of <i>Pokémon Champions</i></b> is used in this tournament by all Junior and Senior players under 12.</p>						</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-ab9209a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="ab9209a" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<p>The ruleset is <a href="https://victoryroad.pro/champions-regulations/"><b>VGC Regulation Set M-C</b></a>, and it is played using open team lists. It is the first event in Europe to feature this ruleset!</p>						</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-b7d4117 elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer" data-id="b7d4117" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="spacer.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<div class="elementor-spacer">
			<div class="elementor-spacer-inner"></div>
		</div>
				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-72ea0f4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="72ea0f4" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
			<h3 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default"><u><i>A little bit of history</i></u></h3>		</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-cb13cf8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="cb13cf8" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<p><b>Germany</b> has been part of the Europe region of the official TPCi circuit for many years. It has hosted multiple major events, including Regional Championships, old-era National Championships and the <a href="https://victoryroad.pro/2019-season-events/europe-internationals/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><b>2019</b></a> <b>and <a href="https://victoryroad.pro/2022/04/24/teams-and-results-from-the-2022-europe-international-championships/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">2022</a> Europe Internationals</b>. Germany&#8217;s greatest VGC success happened when <a href="https://twitter.com/MichaelderBeste" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><b>Michael Kelsch</b></a> reached the finals of the <a href="https://victoryroad.pro/2023-worlds/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">2023 World Championships</a>.</p><p>The most recent tournament held in <b>Germany</b> was the <a href="https://victoryroad.pro/2026-stuttgart/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><b>2026 Stuttgart Regional Championships</b></a>, played in <em>Pokémon Scarlet</em> &amp; <em>Pokémon Violet</em> with the Regulation Set H in December 2025. The <strong><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Z0psXLlPFCE" target="_blank" rel="noopener">finals</a></strong> saw 2024 World Champion <strong><a href="https://x.com/cereevgc">Luca Ceribelli</a></strong> defeat 2022 EUIC Champion <a href="https://x.com/riopaser">Eric Rios</a> to win his first Regional and third major title!</p><p>The last time there was an event in the state of <b>Hesse</b> was the <a href="https://victoryroad.pro/2026-frankfurt/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><b>2026 Frankfurt Regional Championships</b></a>, also played in <em>Pokémon Scarlet</em> &amp; <em>Pokémon Violet </em>with the Regulation Set H in September 2025. The <strong><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=g-2mrEBtMK4" target="_blank" rel="noopener">finals</a></strong> saw Italian player <a href="https://x.com/Lele_Briganti"><b>Emanuele Briganti</b></a> defeat 2025 LAIC finalist <a href="https://x.com/TorvivVGC">Víctor Medina</a> to win his first Regional title!<b></b></p>						</div>
				</div>
					</div>
		</div>
							</div>
		</section>
				<section class="elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-ec9cb57 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default" data-id="ec9cb57" data-element_type="section">
						<div class="elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default">
					<div class="elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-a08127e" data-id="a08127e" data-element_type="column">
			<div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated">
								<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-3c4041a elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer" data-id="3c4041a" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="spacer.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<div class="elementor-spacer">
			<div class="elementor-spacer-inner"></div>
		</div>
				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-2e75ead elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="2e75ead" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
			<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default"><div class="title" style="font-weight:500">Sign-up instructions</div></h2>		</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-c145d3e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="c145d3e" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<p>Sign-ups for the event are done through <a href="https://rk9.gg/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">RK9 Labs</a> platform, and you will first need to set up your <a href="https://rk9.gg/profile" target="_blank" rel="noopener">RK9 profile</a> and have a <a href="https://sso.pokemon.com/sso/login?locale=en&amp;service=https://club.pokemon.com/us/pokemon-trainer-club/caslogin" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Play! Pokémon Player ID</a>.</p><p>Sign-ups are <b>€70</b> for Masters players and <b>€40</b> for Senior and Junior players, and they open on <b>5 August at 19:00 CEST</b> (17:00 UTC). Refunds are partially available up until one week before the event. There are <b>1,068 spots</b> for Masters players, 120 for Senior players and 80 for Junior players.</p><ul><li>A new wave of sign-ups was later announced to open on <b>20 August at 19:00 CEST</b> (17:00 UTC).</li><li>A new wave of sign-ups was later released in mid September unannounced, as some spots became available.</li></ul>						</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-8e98618 elementor-align-center elementor-widget elementor-widget-button" data-id="8e98618" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="button.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<div class="elementor-button-wrapper">
			<a href="https://rk9.gg/tournament/FR002-fiunEHp9wx4mh4" target="_blank" class="elementor-button-link elementor-button elementor-size-sm" role="button">
						<span class="elementor-button-content-wrapper">
							<span class="elementor-button-icon elementor-align-icon-left">
				<i aria-hidden="true" class="fas fa-gamepad"></i>			</span>
						<span class="elementor-button-text">Sign-ups are closed!</span>
		</span>
					</a>
		</div>
				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-5b77d73 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="5b77d73" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<p>If the player cap is not reached, sign-ups close 3 days before the event starts, on 23 September.</p><p>For registered players, team lists must be submitted <b>1 hour before</b> the event starts, by <b>26 September at 7:30 CEST </b>(05:30 UTC).</p>						</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-8497b0e elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="8497b0e" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<p>Spectator passes are <b>€15</b> and can be purchased <strong><a href="https://rk9.gg/spectator/pokemon-frankfurt-2027">here</a></strong>.</p>						</div>
				</div>
					</div>
		</div>
							</div>
		</section>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-73e433e elementor-widget elementor-widget-spacer" data-id="73e433e" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="spacer.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<div class="elementor-spacer">
			<div class="elementor-spacer-inner"></div>
		</div>
				</div>
				</div>
					</div>
		</div>
							</div>
		</section>
				</div>
		</div>
		
	</div>
</div>


<div class="site-footer">
